  Slug: party-scholar
  DisplayName: Party Scholar
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Perhaps because you already achieved what you wanted at school or
    your position makes you invulnerable, you've begun to pour your efforts into
    a lifestyle of hedonistic excess. The fact that the Convocation isn't a months-long
    party might thus come as a rude shock to you, but your skill at deflecting blame
    and making fast friends might mitigate that. Choose two attribute boosts. One
    must be to Constitution or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in Deception. You're also trained in the Alcohol Lore skill or a Lore
    skill associated with your school. You gain the Charming Liar skill feat.
